# This instance's own identity -- the only values that differ between one deployment of this
# repo and another. Non-secret, committed. `make init` rewrites them everywhere they're used
# (and regenerates every secret), so a fork never needs hand-edits. See docs/08-instantiation.md.
#
# REPO_URL       what Argo CD syncs from. https:// for a public fork (no credential needed);
#                git@ for a private one (`make init` generates a deploy key).
# PLATFORM_HOST  the address operators reach the UIs on (Argo CD :9080, Grafana :9082,
#                Keycloak :9083, ...), baked into OIDC redirect URIs and certificate SANs.
# SOPS_AGE_RECIPIENT  public half of the age key every *.enc.yaml is encrypted to.
REPO_URL=git@github.com:utility-soc/dora-blueprint.git
PLATFORM_HOST=192.168.1.106
SOPS_AGE_RECIPIENT=age1wx4euyuda8a03qx674zxjv98e09symv20sfverxn4qrus6se5ucskemhl7
PKI_ORG="Resilience Lab"
PKI_COUNTRY=IE
